              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya olapolosani embata eilo sarge lenye to lkimojino lenye nepik nchumat oo mowuarak eilo perere lo lasar opejorieki ilasarri, neibukoo olikae sarge te ntonata eilo perere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu enkurriny enye pooki, anaa enaitayuni ina kurriny to lasar le seriani, nepejoo olapolosani te nchumata olperere lo lasar metaa esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani; neitayu olapolosani olning'o lo sotua tenkaraki ninye, naa kepalakini ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
